  id: spell-silence
  displayName: Silence
  description: For the duration (concentration, up to 10 minutes), no sound can be created within or pass through a 20-foot-radius sphere centered on a point you choose within range. Creatures entirely inside are immune to thunder damage and deafened, and casting a spell with a verbal component is impossible there. No sound system or verbal-component gating exists yet, so this is authored with Sphere targeting/range/area declared and zero mechanical Effects.
